Package: ricebowl-riceplate-native
Version: 0.1.0~preview1
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: CopyPasteUser
Description: Experimental native RicePlate panel for opt-in RiceBowl Wayland
 Ships the prebuilt x86-64 RicePlate binary as a separate, removable package.
 Does not install a session entry, replace XFCE, or select a default panel.
